      "code_explain": "The script iterates over all 256 IP addresses in the 10.10.0.0/24 range, attempts a TCP connection to port 22 on each, and prints a message if the connection succeeds. This is a direct port scanning (port-sweep) behavior, used for network discovery and reconnaissance.",
